{
  "@context": [
    "context.jsonld",
    {
      "@base": "../../"
    }
  ],
  "id": "benchmark/physics/suite",
  "type": "spo:InformationContentEntity",
  "title": {
    "zh": "物理校验批：预设算例与它们的判据",
    "en": "The physics-check suite: preset cases and their criteria"
  },
  "abstract": {
    "zh": "一条一条：跑哪个算例（scenario，指向 cases/ 语料里的 fyo:ScenarioSpecification），按哪些判据判（criteria）。判据册本身在 `fylite.scenario.physics`：定律（有限性、正性、Grad–Shafranov）与定义（ψ 端点、V′、τ_E 的定义式、β_N 与 Greenwald 的式子）对每个算例一律跑——它们不需要谁来声明；期望（上下界、准稳态窗口）是场景的性质，所以由这里逐条带。★本册子与公开 V&V 登记册（../registry.jsonld）问的不是同一个问题：那边的参考是外部答案，这边的参考是定律与文档自身的定义。",
    "en": "One row per preset case: which scenario to run and which criteria to judge it by. The check register itself lives in `fylite.scenario.physics`; laws and definitions run for every case, while expectations (bounds, steady-state windows) are properties of the scenario and are therefore carried here, case by case. This is a different register from the public V&V one (../registry.jsonld): there the reference is an external answer, here it is physical law and the documents' own definitions."
  },
  "recorded": "2026-09-02",
  "caveat": [
    "上下界是**运行限的常用取法**，不是从某一份参考件量出来的：q95 > 2（扭曲模的常规下界）、Greenwald 分数 ≤ 1.2（密度极限；>1 的运行是有的，故取 1.2 而不是 1）、β_N ≤ 4（Troyon 型无壁极限的常用上界 3–4）。它们的 tolerance_basis 因此是 reference_stated，判不过读作「这一炮落在声明的窗口外」，不读作「代码错了」。",
    "算例本身的能力边界（哪些开关本仓还没沉下来）由 `fylite cases --plan` 说；本册子不复述它，跑不动的算例在批次里记为「没有产出可判」并写明理由。"
  ],
  "has_part": [
    {
      "id": "physics/evolve-default",
      "title": {
        "zh": "缺省演化：一次 1.5-D 输运推进的自洽性",
        "en": "The default march: self-consistency of one 1.5-D transport advance"
      },
      "scenario": "cases/evolve-default",
      "concretized_as": [
        {
          "type": "spo:Concretization",
          "storage_uri": "cases/evolve-default.jsonld",
          "format_iri": "https://www.iana.org/assignments/media-types/application/ld+json"
        }
      ],
      "criteria": [
        {
          "type": "fyo:AcceptanceCriterion",
          "quantity_label": "energy-balance",
          "norm": "relative",
          "tolerance": {
            "type": "spo:QuantityValue",
            "numeric_value": 0.05
          },
          "tolerance_basis": "measured_band",
          "p_heat_terms": [
            "p_ohm",
            "p_aux",
            "p_alpha",
            "-p_rad"
          ],
          "caveat": [
            "出厂设置不开辐射时 p_rad 为零，这一项照样计入（口径写在结论里）"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "physics/evolve-iter-15ma",
      "title": {
        "zh": "ITER 15 MA 感应燃烧：定律、定义，加上这一炮该落在哪",
